					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: BASIC OPERATION\n\nIn this example we calculate which index of the Sequence node (running 2 to 1) is nearest to 3.6.\nThe Nearest node returns a 2, which means that the value of index 2 is nearest to 3.6.\nWhen we use Read to retrieve index 2 from the Sequence we get 4."
					}
				},
